Package: auguryanalytics
Type: Package
Title: Lead-Lag and Calibration Analytics for Augury
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Augury", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Econometric analysis of the relationship between social stance
    signals and prediction-market prices. Provides logit-space Granger causality
    testing with ADF stationarity checks and Benjamini-Hochberg FDR correction
    across markets, plus Brier and Brier Skill Score calibration measurement
    against the market's own price as the reference forecast.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
