    DBI,
    RPostgres,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    tibble,
    ggplot2,
    tseries,
    vars,
    lmtest,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    quarto,
    knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
